_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "         childQuantityList enumerates the TLCs packed onto the pallet." .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "         epcList = [pallet SSCC]. bizTransactionList carries desadv + bol KDEs." .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "         sourceList/destinationList carry the shipped-from and immediate-subsequent-recipient GLNs." .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "('Aggregation Add + Object Observe' variant, pages 32-34)." .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event 1: TransformationEvent (creating_class_instance), TLC-source reference for the food being shipped." .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event 2: AggregationEvent (action=ADD, bizStep=packing), pallet build. parentID = SSCC Digital Link;" .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event 3: ObjectEvent (action=OBSERVE, bizStep=shipping, disposition=in_transit):" .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shipping CTE per GS1 US 'EPCIS Recommendations for FSMA 204 CTEs' R2.0, §6" .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shipping KDEs not shown here (ref doc type/number, date shipped) ride in the ObjectEvent's" .
_:b247_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "bizTransactionList + eventTime per GS1 US §6." .
